0..47 Comment "/// This source shows recursive module members."
48..51 Comment "///"
52..128 Comment "/// `Counting` and `Iterating` each contain a recursive definition. A module"
129..206 Comment "/// groups a recursive definition with the definitions beside it. A fold over"
207..270 Comment "/// the terms of a model is a functor member that calls itself."
271..274 Comment "///"
275..350 Comment "/// The checker resolves a recursive member one stage below its definition."
351..410 Comment "/// A client resolves every member through its module path."
411..414 Comment "///"
415..431 Comment "/// - see: #4145"
